aina.org/sci-mathematics/lean"}, {"title": "lean 4.24.0.ebuild", "url": "https://mirrors.kernel.org/gentoo-portage/sci-mathematics/lean/lean-4.24.0.ebuild"}, {"title": "• All Packages", "url": "https://reservoir.lean-lang.org/@leanprover/versowebcomponents"}, {"title": "lean 4.24.0.ebuild", "url": "https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/gentoo-portage/sci-mathematics/lean/lean-4.24.0.ebuild"}, {"title": "Lean (proof assistant)", "url": "https://wiki.krisyotam.com/content/wikipedia_en_all_nopic_2026-03/Lean_4"}]}, "The search didn't return the LICENSE file from the leanprover/lean4 GitHub repository itself. Packaging and reference sources do list Lean 4's license as Apache-2.0, though:\n\n- A Gentoo ebuild for Lean 4.24.0 sets the license field to Apache-2.0, and the same license appears in the Gentoo 4.14.0 build file as well.\n- An openSUSE spec for Lean 4.15.0 lists the License as Apache-2.0 and points the URL to the leanprover/lean4 GitHub repository.\n- A Wikipedia mirror's infobox for Lean shows the license as Apache 2.0, and it describes Lean as a free and open-source software project hosted on GitHub.\n\nCaveat: none of these sources quotes the repository's LICENSE text directly. The Apache-2.0 claim comes from downstream packaging and a reference article, so checking github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/master/LICENSE would confirm it. I also found a Reservoir page for a separate Lean project that shows Apache 2.0, but that's a different project, so it doesn't verify Lean 4's own license."], "durationSeconds": 7.22386925, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01PYeMNVLFb63LBGp2hAEqqc", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDY6SkCHwL1bPXZSGRek", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：Apache License 2.0。**\n\n依据是下游打包文件和百科镜像,不是仓库里的 LICENSE 原文。我只搜了 1 次,没有直接查到 leanprover/lean4 仓库的 LICENSE 文件。要最终确认,可以看 github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/master/LICENSE。\n\n- Gentoo 的 Lean 4.24.0 ebuild 把许可证写成 Apache-2.0。\n- openSUSE 的 lean4.spec 写 License: Apache-2.0,项目地址指向 leanprover/lean4 仓库。\n- 维基百科镜像的信息框也标注 Apache 2.0。\n\nSources:\n- [lean 4.24.0.ebuild (Gentoo, riken.jp)](https://ftp.riken.jp/Linux/gentoo-portage/sci-mathematics/lean/lean-4.24.0.ebuild)\n- [lean4.spec (openSUSE)](https://src.opensuse.org/science/lean4/src/branch/main/lean4.spec)\n- [Lean (proof assistant), Wikipedia 镜像](https://wiki.krisyotam.com/content/wikipedia_en_all_nopic_2026-03/Lean_4)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1196, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4284, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1196}, "output_tokens": 436, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:04:49.749Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDY6SSLMf5pDh3YSHCbe"}
